  birdName: Phoenix
  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 0bbd022a36a86f94a979510a91f5fb40, type: 3}
  description: "This bird is a symbol of renewal and rebirth, so they get a steady
    offering of wood to keep themselves lit. They also like to quote, \u201CLike
    the Phoenix, I have risen from the ashes! And into my fire, you shall fall!\u201D
    - TMNT Shredder 2003, for some reason."
  offensiveAbility: Burn ball - turn enemies into rotisserie chickens, unable to
    use abilities if hit (8s cooldown for rotisserie chickens) (20s cooldown for
    ability)
  offensiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 8373ac9aec4d220459ec4fdf3286c39d, type: 3}
  defensiveAbility: Revive - One missed ball during a rally can be revived (from
    the ashes) to be back in play (20s cooldown)
  defensiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 271a88fe78ba3fb4f8ba150c508528be, type: 3}
  groundSpeed: 8
  jumpForce: 3
